{"id":"e25782b46387","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations","lang":"en","title":"External organizations","description":"As part of its third mandate, Università della Svizzera italiana (USI) is actively engaged in promoting dialogue with society, making a concrete contribution to the cultural, social, and economic development of the region.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","International Relations","Specific information for:"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-inclusione.jpg?itok=gD_RxBOh","words":227,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint/informazioni-specifiche/enti-esterni","en":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"International Relations","path":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Specific information for:","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"External organizations","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>As part of its <strong>third mandate</strong>, Università della Svizzera italiana (USI) is actively engaged in promoting dialogue with society, making a concrete contribution to the cultural, social, and economic development of the region. This commitment is reflected in various initiatives and projects that foster collaboration with actors outside the academic world, such as public institutions, international organizations, and cultural and social institutions.</p> <p>Among these projects are activities coordinated by the <strong>International Relations and Study Abroad Service</strong>, which operates with a strong international and inclusive vocation.</p> <p>In particular:</p> <ul> <li><strong>InclUSIone</strong> is a program that promotes access to university for people from the asylum sector, contributing to the integration and realization of the potential of this particularly vulnerable group of students.</li> </ul> <p>The program concurs to concretely realize the objectives set at both <a href=\"https://www.ebg.admin.ch/it/nsb?id=104660\">national </a>and <a href=\"https://globalcompactrefugees.org/pledges-contributions/multi-stakeholder-pledges-2023/multi-stakeholder-pledge-achieving-15?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">international</a> level to improve access to tertiary education for refugees.</p> <p>Detailed information about the InclUSIone program are available on the dedicated page.</p> <ul> <li><strong>Scholars at Risk</strong> is an initiative that reflects USI’s commitment to protecting academic freedom by offering support to researchers who are threatened or persecuted in their countries of origin.</li> </ul> <p>Detailed information about the Scholars at Risk program are available on the dedicated page.</p> <p>If you would like more information about possible collaborations with the International Relations and Study Abroad Service within the framework of the aforementioned projects, please write to: relint@usi.ch</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Iniziative"},{"t":"cards","items":[{"title":"InclUSIone","href":"/it/universita/info/relint/inclusione","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-inclusione.jpg?itok=gD_RxBOh"},{"title":"Scholars at Risk","href":"/en/originalnode/41983","image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/relint-sar.jpg?itok=UjBfOzMu"}]}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad","href":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Governance","href":"/en/universita/info/relint/governance"},{"label":"Strategy and objectives 2025-2028","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/internationalization-strategy-goals"},{"label":"International relations commission","href":"/en/university/info/relint/commission"},{"label":"International collaborations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/partnerships"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/relint/annual-report"},{"label":"Statistical data","href":"/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures"},{"label":"All categories","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"USI students","href":"/en/university/info/relint/usi-student"},{"label":"Incoming exchanges","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-exchange-students"},{"label":"Incoming internships","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-mobility-for-internship"},{"label":"InclUSIone","href":"/en/university/info/relint/inclusione"},{"label":"ESKAS scholarship holders","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/swiss-government-excellence-scholarships"},{"label":"Scholars at Risk","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/scholars-at-risk-network"},{"label":"USI academic staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/academic-staff"},{"label":"USI staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff"},{"label":"Incoming academic body","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-academic-staff"},{"label":"Incoming staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-staff-mobilities"},{"label":"Visiting researchers","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers"},{"label":"External organisations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations"},{"label":"Partner universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universita-partner"},{"label":"Interested universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested"},{"label":"Internationalisation at home - I@H","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/internationalization-at-home"},{"label":"\"Come and Go\" newsletter","href":"/en/university/info/relint/come-go-archive"},{"label":"Events","href":"/en/university/info/relint/events"},{"label":"Il mondo in USI","href":"/en/university/info/relint/il-mondo-in-usi"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/university/info/relint/news"},{"label":"Team and contacts","href":"/en/university/info/relint/team"},{"label":"2005-2025: 20 years of activity","href":"/en/university/info/relint/20-years-of-activity"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:58:12.494Z"}